<title>HONG KONG: Hualing 1996 net loss HK$78.44 mln.</title>
<headline>Hualing 1996 net loss HK$78.44 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.6 loss  vs  6.7 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    78.44 loss vs  40.11 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,050.49   vs  1,039.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hualing Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hualing Holdings is a China-based refrigerator manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one 1999 warrant for every five shares held. Each bonus warrant will entitle the holder to subscribe for one new share at the initial subscription price of HK$1.48 per share, subject to adjustment, at any time on or after its date of issue -- expected to be July 3, 1997 -- to March 31, 1999.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and final dividend have not been adjusted for the one-for-three rights issue in November 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is nil vs two H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
